    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Rapid Takeover](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.outlander-claw.rapid-takeover) (Outlander Claw):\n\n- Each **GENESTEALER CULTS MOUNTED** or **VEHICLE** model of yours has +1 OC while it is not **Battle-shocked**.\n- As your Command phase ends, an **objective** you control stays yours if at least 1 **ATALAN JACKALS** unit of yours is in range of it, until, as any phase ends, your opponent has the higher **Level of Control** there.",
